  "label": "Social Stigma Around Alcohol Use",
  "description": "The societal perception that using alcohol to cope with stress or emotional problems is a negative or unhealthy behavior. While the meme uses this as a humorous device, it implicitly references the social stigma associated with alcohol use as a coping mechanism, which may be seen as a form of self-medication or emotional avoidance. This stigma is part of the broader cultural context that makes the meme's humor relatable or ironic to some viewers.",
